{"timestamp": "2025-06-26T12:06:13.810104", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  def satisfies_goal(state, goal_item):\n      return state.inventory[goal_item] > 0\n\n  def heuristic(state, goal_item):\n      # A simple heuristic: number of items needed to reach the goal\n      goal_requirements = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(goal_item)\n      current_inventory = {idx: count for idx, count in enumerate(state.inventory) if count > 0}\n      \n      total_items_needed = sum(goal_requirements.get(idx, 0) - current_inventory.get(idx, 0) for idx in goal_requirements)\n      return max(total_items_needed, 1)  # Ensure the heuristic is always positive\n\n  def a_star_search(initial_state, goal_item):\n      from queue import PriorityQueue\n      \n      open_set = PriorityQueue()\n      open_set.put((0, initial_state, []))  # (f_score, state, path)\n      came_from = {}", "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
